  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### One crash re-runs a chain of calls\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 9  \u00b7  **Symptom:** One crash re-runs five calls.  \u00b7  **Cause:** Long chain of local activities in one workflow task, no checkpoint.  \u00b7  **Fix:** Put a regular activity or a durable step between groups; keep chains short.\n\n**What to watch:** API re-executions by step after each crash: all five steps re-run without checkpoints, only the last group with them.\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | baseline | warm up | 30 s |  |\n| 2 | broken | 5 local calls, no checkpoint; crash worker-a | 60 s |  |\n| 3 | baseline | recover | 30 s |  |\n| 4 | fixed | checkpoint every 2 calls; crash worker-a | 60 s | A 1 ms timer after every 2 local calls completes the workflow task and persists their markers. |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Phase",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "demo_scenario_variant{scenario=\"long-chain\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
